exports[`deed generators > genADJT > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC</div><div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL TO:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt 0;"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 12pt;"><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:12pt;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">Mail Tax Statements To:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">The Public Family Trust<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA</div></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-left:12pt;border-left:1px solid #ccc;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">The Undersigned Declare(s):</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Documentary Transfer Tax: $0<br>Building Homes and Jobs Act Fee: $-0-<br>GC §27388.1(a)(2)(B) — Residential dwelling to owner-occupier</div></td></tr></table><hr class="rule"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:13pt;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0;">AFFIDAVIT OF DEATH OF JOINT TENANT</div><hr class="rule"><div class="body-text">I, Mary R. Public, being duly sworn, say:</div><div class="body-text">I am over the age of 18 years. The decedent described in the attached certified copy of Certificate of Death is the same person as Robert Q. Public<br>(Also known as Bob Public), who is named as one of the parties in that certain Deed of Trust dated June 1, 2024, executed by John Q. Public, to John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife, as Joint Tenants, recorded on June 5, 2024 as Instrument No. 2024-0123456, in the Official Records of Los Angeles County, California, covering the property situated in the City of Pasadena, Los Angeles County, California, described as follows:</div><div class="body-text indent" style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</div><div class="body-text">Commonly known as 123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101, Pasadena, CA<br>Assessor&#39;s Parcel Number: 5555-012-034</div><div style="display:table;width:100%;margin:20pt 0;"><div style="display:table-cell;width:40%;vertical-align:bottom;">Date: _______________________________</div><div style="display:table-cell;width:60%;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:center;">________________________________________<br>Mary R. Public<br>Affiant</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div class="jurat-title">JURAT</div><div class="jurat-block"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table>Subscribed and sworn to (or affirmed) before me on this __________ day of _________________, 2026, by Mary R. Public, proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) who appeared before me.<br><br><br>_______________________________&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Seal)<br>Notary Public</div><div class="body-text" style="margin-top:16pt;font-weight:bold;">ATTACH CERTIFIED COPY OF DEATH CERTIFICATE</div>"`;

exports[`deed generators > genADTR > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div class="rec-hdr">Recording Requested By:</div><div class="rec-hdr">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><div class="rec-hdr" style="margin-top:8pt">And When Recorded Mail To:</div><div class="rec-hdr">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr class="rec-rule"><div class="rec-space">Space above this line for Recorder's use only</div><hr class="rec-rule"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12pt 0;"><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:12pt;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">Mail Tax Statements To:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Mary R. Public, Trustee<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA</div></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-left:12pt;border-left:1px solid #ccc;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">The Undersigned Declare(s):</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Mary R. Public<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA<br><br>Documentary Transfer Tax: $0<br>Building Homes and Jobs Act Fee: $-0-<br>GC §27388.1(a)(2)(B)</div></td></tr></table><hr class="rule"><div class="doc-title">AFFIDAVIT OF DEATH OF TRUSTEE</div><hr class="rule"><div class="body-text">Mary R. Public, Trustee of the The Public Family Trust, of legal age, being first duly sworn, deposes and says:</div><div class="body-text">That Robert Q. Public, the decedent mentioned in the attached certified copy of the Certificate of Death, is the same person as Robert Q. Public named as one of the parties, to wit, Trustee of the The Public Family Trust, in that certain Grant Deed dated March 1, 2020, recorded as Document Number 2024-0123456, of Official Records of the Los Angeles County Recorder, covering the real property situated in the County of Los Angeles, State of California, more fully described as follows:</div><div class="body-text indent" style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</div><div class="body-text indent">Assessor's Parcel Number: 5555-012-034</div><div class="body-text indent">Commonly known as:<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA</div><div class="body-text">As a result of the death of Robert Q. Public, I, Mary R. Public, am the current acting Trustee of the The Public Family Trust and by this instrument, I accept that office. The The Public Family Trust has not been revoked and was in full force and effect upon the death of Robert Q. Public. The Trust remains in full force and effect.</div><div class="body-text">I declare under penalty of perjury, under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing statements are true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">Executed this __________ day of ______________________, 2026, at _____________________, California.</div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">Mary R. Public, Trustee of the<br>The Public Family Trust</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div class="jurat-title">JURAT</div><div class="jurat-block"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table>Subscribed and sworn to (or affirmed) before me on this __________ day of _________________, 2026, by Mary R. Public, proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) who appeared before me.<br><br><br>_______________________________&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Seal)<br>Notary Public</div>"`;

exports[`deed generators > genDOT > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC</div><div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL TO:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin:18pt 0 12pt;">FIRST DEED OF TRUST</div><div class="body-text">THIS FIRST DEED OF TRUST, made this ______ day of _________________, 2026, between John Q. Public, whose address is 123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101, herein called "Trustors", First American Title Insurance Company, a California corporation, as "Trustee," and Acme Lending, Inc., herein called "Beneficiaries",</div><div class="body-text">WITNESSETH: That Trustors irrevocably grant, transfer and assign to the Trustee, in trust, with power of sale, Trustors' interest in the real property situated in the County of Los Angeles, State of California, described in "Exhibit A" attached hereto.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>APN(s):</strong> 5555-012-034</div><div class="body-text">TOGETHER WITH the rents, issues, and profits thereof, for the purpose of securing payment of the indebtedness evidenced by a promissory note of even date herewith, executed by Trustors in the principal amount of Five Hundred Thousand ($500,000).</div><div class="body-text"><strong>PART A — COVENANTS OF TRUSTOR</strong></div><div class="body-text">To protect the security of this Deed of Trust, Trustor covenants and agrees as follows:<br><br>1. Payment of Principal and Interest. To promptly pay when due the principal of and interest on the Note, including any prepayment charges, late fees, and all other sums secured by this Deed of Trust.<br><br>2. Payment of Taxes and Assessments. To pay, prior to delinquency, all taxes, assessments, charges, and liens now or hereafter levied or assessed upon the property.<br><br>3. Insurance. To keep the improvements insured against damage by fire and such other hazards as Beneficiaries may require, in amounts sufficient to cover all sums secured by this Deed of Trust.<br><br>4. Defense of Title. To appear in and defend any action or proceeding purporting to affect the security hereof or the rights or powers of Beneficiaries or Trustee.<br><br>5. Maintenance and Repair of Property. To keep the property in good condition and repair; not to remove or demolish any buildings without prior written consent of Beneficiaries.<br><br>6. Compliance with Law. To comply with all applicable laws, ordinances, regulations, covenants, conditions, and restrictions affecting the property.<br><br>7. Costs, Fees, and Expenses. To pay when due all costs, fees, and expenses of this trust, including reasonable compensation of the Trustee.<br><br>8. Further Assurances. Upon written request of Beneficiaries, to make and deliver any instruments reasonably requested to carry out the intent and purpose of this Deed of Trust.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>LATE CHARGE:</strong> If any payment is not received within 10 calendar days after it is due, Trustor shall pay a late charge equal to 6% of the overdue amount.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>PREPAYMENT:</strong> This Deed of Trust may be prepaid in whole or in part at any time without penalty.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>DUE ON SALE:</strong> In the event the herein described property is sold, conveyed, or alienated by Trustor, all obligations secured by this instrument shall, at the option of the holder, immediately become due and payable.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>PART B — TRUSTEE AND BENEFICIARY PROVISIONS</strong></div><div class="body-text">The following provisions are an integral part of this Deed of Trust:<br><br>1. Trustee&#39;s Obligations Upon Payment in Full. Upon written request of Beneficiaries stating that all sums secured hereby have been paid in full, and upon surrender of this Deed of Trust and the Note to Trustee, Trustee shall reconvey, without warranty, the property then held hereunder.<br><br>2. Trustee&#39;s Authority; Acceptance of Trust. Trustee accepts this trust when this Deed of Trust, duly executed and acknowledged, is made a public record as provided by law.<br><br>3. Trustee&#39;s Fees and Costs. Trustee shall be entitled to reasonable compensation for all services rendered in the administration of this trust.<br><br>4. Substitution of Trustee. Beneficiaries may substitute a successor Trustee by instrument in writing duly acknowledged and recorded.<br><br>5. Authority to Collect Rents, Issues, and Profits. Upon default by Trustor, Beneficiaries shall have the right to collect the rents, issues, and profits of the property.<br><br>6. Acceleration Upon Default; Power of Sale. Upon default, Beneficiaries may declare all sums secured hereby immediately due and payable and shall cause Trustee to execute a written notice of default and election to sell.<br><br>7. Trustee&#39;s Deed Upon Sale. Trustee shall deliver to the purchaser its deed conveying the property, without any covenant or warranty, express or implied.<br><br>8. Application of Proceeds of Sale. After deducting all costs, fees, and expenses, Trustee shall apply proceeds to: (a) sums expended hereunder; (b) all other sums secured; and (c) the remainder to persons legally entitled.<br><br>9. Inspection of Property. Beneficiaries may make reasonable entries and inspections of the property upon reasonable prior written notice.<br><br>10. Condemnation. The proceeds of any condemnation award are hereby assigned to Beneficiaries.</div><div class="body-text">Acme Lending, Inc.<br>9 Finance Way, Los Angeles, CA 90001</div><div class="body-text">Executed this ______ day of _________________, 2026, at _____________________, California.</div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">John Q. Public</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div style="margin-top:14pt;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="body-text">On _____________ before me, _________________________, Notary Public, personally appeared _________________________, who proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) whose name(s) is/are subscribed to the within instrument and acknowledged to me that he/she/they executed the same in his/her/their authorized capacity(ies), and that by his/her/their signature(s) on the instrument the person(s), or the entity upon behalf of which the person(s) acted, executed the instrument.</div><div class="body-text">I certify under PENALTY OF PERJURY under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing paragraph is true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">WITNESS my hand and official seal.</div><div style="margin-top:20pt;">Signature _________________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Seal)</div></div><div class="body-text" style="margin-top:16pt;">First Deed of Trust for property commonly known as:<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101, Pasadena, CA<br>APNs: 5555-012-034</div>"`;

exports[`deed generators > genDOTMod > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC</div><div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL TO:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin:18pt 0 12pt;">MODIFICATION OF DEED OF TRUST</div><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12pt;"><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:12pt;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">Mail Tax Statements To:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Acme Lending, Inc.<br>9 Finance Way, Los Angeles, CA 90001</div></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-left:12pt;border-left:1px solid #ccc;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">The Undersigned Declare(s):</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Documentary Transfer Tax: $0<br>Building Homes and Jobs Act Fee: $-0-<br>GC §27388.1(a)(2)(B)</div></td></tr></table><hr class="rule"><div class="body-text">THIS MODIFICATION OF DEED OF TRUST is entered into as of ______________________, 2026, by and between:</div><div class="body-text">TRUSTOR: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; John Q. Public, a married man as his sole and separate property<br>TRUSTEE: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; First American Title Insurance Company<br>BENEFICIARY: Acme Lending, Inc.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9 Finance Way, Los Angeles, CA 90001</div><div class="body-text"><strong>RECITALS:</strong></div><div class="body-text">A. Trustor executed that certain First Deed of Trust dated June 1, 2024, recorded on June 5, 2024 as Document Number 2024-0123456 in the Official Records of Los Angeles County, California, encumbering the real property described as:</div><div class="body-text indent" style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</div><div class="body-text">Assessor&#39;s Parcel Number: 5555-012-034<br>Commonly known as: 123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101, Pasadena, CA</div><div class="body-text">B. Original principal amount: $500,000</div><div class="body-text"><strong>AGREEMENT:</strong></div><div class="body-text"><strong>1. MODIFICATIONS:</strong><br>Interest-only for 24 months.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>2. MODIFIED LOAN AMOUNT:</strong> $525,000</div><div class="body-text"><strong>3. MODIFIED MATURITY DATE:</strong> June 1, 2054</div><div class="body-text"><strong>4. MODIFIED INTEREST RATE:</strong> 6.5%% per annum</div><div class="body-text"><strong>5. RATIFICATION:</strong> Except as modified herein, all terms of the Original Deed of Trust remain in full force and effect.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>TRUSTOR:</strong></div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">John Q. Public</div></div><div class="body-text" style="margin-top:20pt;"><strong>BENEFICIARY:</strong></div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">Acme Lending, Inc.</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div style="margin-top:14pt;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="body-text">On _____________ before me, _________________________, Notary Public, personally appeared _________________________, who proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) whose name(s) is/are subscribed to the within instrument and acknowledged to me that he/she/they executed the same in his/her/their authorized capacity(ies), and that by his/her/their signature(s) on the instrument the person(s), or the entity upon behalf of which the person(s) acted, executed the instrument.</div><div class="body-text">I certify under PENALTY OF PERJURY under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing paragraph is true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">WITNESS my hand and official seal.</div><div style="margin-top:20pt;">Signature _________________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Seal)</div></div>"`;

