exports[`deed generators > genSSCP > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC</div><div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL TO:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:13pt;font-weight:bold;margin:18pt 0 4pt;">AFFIDAVIT OF SURVIVING SPOUSE</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">Succeeding to Title to Community Property</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:12pt;">(Probate Code §13540, State of California)</div><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12pt;"><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:12pt;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">Mail Tax Statements To:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101</div></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-left:12pt;border-left:1px solid #ccc;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">The Undersigned Declare(s):</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Documentary Transfer Tax: $0<br>Building Homes and Jobs Act Fee: $-0-<br>GC §27388.1(a)(2)(B) — Residential dwelling to owner-occupier</div></td></tr></table><hr class="rule"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">STATE OF CALIFORNIA</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">COUNTY OF LOS ANGELES</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="body-text">John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife, of legal age, being first duly sworn, deposes and says:</div><div class="body-text">That Robert Q. Public, the decedent mentioned in the attached Certificate of Death, is the same person as Robert Q. Public named as one of the parties in that certain Grant Deed dated June 1, 2024, executed by John Q. Public, to Robert Q. Public and John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife, husband and wife as community property, recorded as Document Number 2024-0123456 on June 5, 2024, of Official Records of the Los Angeles County Recorder, covering the real property situated in the County of Los Angeles, State of California, more fully described as follows:</div><div class="body-text indent" style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</div><div class="body-text indent">Assessor&#39;s Parcel Number: 5555-012-034</div><div class="body-text indent">Commonly known as:<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA</div><div class="body-text">That John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife was married to Robert Q. Public at the time of the death of the decedent.</div><div class="body-text">That the above-described property has been at all times since acquisition considered the community property of John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife and Robert Q. Public. More than forty (40) days have passed since the death of the above-named decedent, and no notice has been recorded pursuant to Probate Code §13541.</div><div class="body-text">That, with respect to the above-described property, there has not been nor will there be an election filed pursuant to Probate Code §§13502 or 13503 in any probate proceedings in any court of competent jurisdiction.</div><div class="body-text">That the above described property has not passed to someone other than the affiant under the decedent&#39;s will or by intestate succession. That the property has not been disposed of in trust under the decedent&#39;s will. That the decedent&#39;s will does not limit the affiant to a qualified ownership.</div><div class="body-text">That this Affidavit is made for the protection and benefit of the surviving spouse, his/her successors, assigns and personal representatives and all other parties hereafter dealing with or who may acquire an interest in the above described property.</div><div class="body-text">I declare under penalty of perjury, under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing statements are true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">Executed this __________ day of ______________________, 2026, at _____________________, California.</div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife, Declarant</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div class="jurat-title">JURAT</div><div class="jurat-block"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table>Subscribed and sworn to (or affirmed) before me on this __________ day of _________________, 2026, by John Q. Public and Mary R. Public, husband and wife, proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) who appeared before me.<br><br><br>_______________________________&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Seal)<br>Notary Public</div>"`;

exports[`deed generators > genSheriff > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC</div><div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:4pt;">AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL TO:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">Public Law Group, APC<br>100 Attorney Plaza, Suite 400<br>Los Angeles, California 90071</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt 0;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt 0;"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 12pt;"><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-right:12pt;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">Mail Tax Statements To:</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">The Public Family Trust<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA</div></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding-left:12pt;border-left:1px solid #ccc;"><div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3pt;">The Undersigned Declare(s):</div><div style="font-size:11pt;">Documentary Transfer Tax: $330.00<br>Building Homes and Jobs Act Fee: $75</div></td></tr></table><div style="text-align:center;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin:18pt 0 12pt;">SHERIFF&#39;S DEED</div><div class="body-text">APN: 5555-012-034 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; County: Los Angeles &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; City: Pasadena</div><div class="body-text">Sheriff of Los Angeles County, Sheriff of Los Angeles County, California, pursuant to a Writ of Execution/Sale issued out of the Superior Court of California, County of Los Angeles, Case Number 24STPB01234, entitled In re Estate of Public, pursuant to a Judgment entered on March 1, 2024, in favor of Acme Lending, Inc. and against John Q. Public, does hereby GRANT AND CONVEY to:</div><div class="body-text">The Public Family Trust, as Trustees of The Public Family Trust dated March 1, 2020,</div><div class="body-text">all right, title, and interest of John Q. Public in and to the following described real property in the County of Los Angeles, State of California:</div><div class="body-text indent" style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</div><div class="body-text">Assessor&#39;s Parcel Number: 5555-012-034<br>Commonly known as: 123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101, Pasadena, CA</div><div class="body-text">The above-described property was sold at public auction on May 1, 2024, at Los Angeles County Courthouse, pursuant to said Writ and the Notice of Sale duly given as required by law. At the sale, The Public Family Trust was the highest bidder and became the purchaser of the property for the sum of $450,000, which sum was paid.</div><div class="body-text">[REDEMPTION STATUS REQUIRED — state either: the sale was not subject to any right of redemption; OR the property was sold subject to the right of redemption and the applicable three-month (CCP 729.030(a)) or one-year (CCP 729.030(b)) redemption period has expired without redemption.]</div><div class="body-text">This deed is made without covenant or warranty, express or implied, and conveys only such right, title, and interest as the judgment debtor, John Q. Public, held at the time of levy.</div><div class="body-text">Executed this __________ day of ______________________, 2026, at _____________________, California.</div><div class="sig-block"><div class="sig-line">________________________________________</div><div class="sig-name">Sheriff of Los Angeles County<br>Sheriff, Los Angeles County, California</div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div style="margin-top:14pt;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="body-text">On _____________ before me, _________________________, Notary Public, personally appeared _________________________, who proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) whose name(s) is/are subscribed to the within instrument and acknowledged to me that he/she/they executed the same in his/her/their authorized capacity(ies), and that by his/her/their signature(s) on the instrument the person(s), or the entity upon behalf of which the person(s) acted, executed the instrument in his/her/their authorized capacity(ies) as Sheriff/Public Official of the county named in the instrument.</div><div class="body-text">I certify under PENALTY OF PERJURY under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing paragraph is true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">WITNESS my hand and official seal.</div><div style="margin-top:20pt;">Signature _________________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Seal)</div></div>"`;

exports[`deed generators > genTOD > matches the approved baseline (regression lock) 1`] = `"<div style="font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:14pt;">RECORDING REQUESTED BY AND WHEN RECORDED MAIL DOCUMENT AND TAX STATEMENT TO:<br><br>John Q. Public<br>123 Main Street, Pasadena, CA 91101<br>Pasadena, CA 91101</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:6pt 0 2pt;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:9pt;color:#444;margin-bottom:2pt;">Space above this line for Recorder&#39;s use only</div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #000;margin:0 0 14pt;"><div style="text-align:center;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin:18pt 0 4pt;">REVOCABLE TRANSFER ON DEATH (TOD) DEED</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:11pt;margin-bottom:12pt;">(California Probate Code §5642)</div><div class="body-text"><strong>ASSESSOR&#39;S PARCEL NUMBER:</strong> 5555-012-034</div><div class="body-text" style="border:1.5pt solid #000;padding:8pt 10pt;background:#fff8f0;">&#9888; <strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE: THIS DEED MUST BE RECORDED ON OR BEFORE 60 DAYS AFTER THE DATE IT IS NOTARIZED.</strong></div><div class="body-text">This document is exempt from documentary transfer tax under Revenue &amp; Taxation Code §11930.<br>This document is exempt from preliminary change of ownership report under Revenue &amp; Taxation Code §480.3.</div><div class="body-text"><strong>PROPERTY DESCRIPTION:</strong><br><span style="font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-size:10pt;">Lot 5 of Tract No. 12345, in the City of Pasadena, County of Los Angeles, State of California, as per map recorded in Book 200, Pages 10-12 of Maps.</span></div><div class="body-text"><strong>BENEFICIARY(IES):</strong><br>[BENEFICIARY NAME]<br>Relationship to transferor: daughter</div><div class="body-text"><strong>TRANSFER ON DEATH</strong><br>I transfer all of my interest in the described property to the named beneficiary(ies) on my death. I may revoke this deed. When recorded, this deed revokes any TOD deed that I made before signing this deed.</div><div style="display:table;width:100%;margin:20pt 0;"><div style="display:table-cell;width:40%;vertical-align:bottom;">Date _______________________</div><div style="display:table-cell;width:60%;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom;"><div style="border-bottom:1px solid #000;padding-bottom:2pt;">John Q. Public</div><div style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:3pt;">Signature of Grantor</div></div></div><div class="notary-box">A notary public or other officer completing this certificate verifies only the identity of the individual who signed the document to which this certificate is attached, and not the truthfulness, accuracy, or validity of that document.</div><div style="margin-top:14pt;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.4;"><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">State of California</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;"></td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 6pt;">ss.</td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap;padding:0;">County of _______________</td><td style="padding:0 0 0 10pt;">)</td><td style="padding:0;"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="body-text">On _____________ before me, _________________________, Notary Public, personally appeared _________________________, who proved to me on the basis of satisfactory evidence to be the person(s) whose name(s) is/are subscribed to the within instrument and acknowledged to me that he/she/they executed the same in his/her/their authorized capacity(ies), and that by his/her/their signature(s) on the instrument the person(s), or the entity upon behalf of which the person(s) acted, executed the instrument.</div><div class="body-text">I certify under PENALTY OF PERJURY under the laws of the State of California that the foregoing paragraph is true and correct.</div><div class="body-text">WITNESS my hand and official seal.</div><div style="margin-top:20pt;">Signature _________________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Seal)</div></div><div class="body-text" style="margin-top:16pt;border:1px solid #000;padding:8pt 10pt;"><strong>WITNESSES (both must be present simultaneously):</strong><br><br>Signature Witness #1 ___________________________________<br>Printed Name Witness #1 ___________________________________<br><br>Signature Witness #2 ___________________________________<br>Printed Name Witness #2 ___________________________________</div><div class="body-text" style="font-size:9pt;color:#444;">Rev 1/1/2022</div>"`;

